{"4856820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Тоskа-74", "steam_appid": 4856820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/f86ce947683f0280634d470f526c1f4b.poster.avif?t=1784908481\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/f86ce947683f0280634d470f526c1f4b.webm?t=1784908481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/f86ce947683f0280634d470f526c1f4b.mp4?t=1784908481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT TOSKA-74</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The year is 1974. Somewhere deep in the lush woods of Siberia, the firmament of reality has lost its grip.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without warning, the sky turned a suffocating, dense grey, then the sky lit up. Gravity lost its stronghold on the mundane—and the chairs rose to the ceiling. Reality has turned from an absolute - to a partial existence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;<i>He who fights with monsters should look to it that he himself does not become a monster. And if you gaze long into an abyss, the abyss also gazes into you.&quot; </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE PSYCHEDELIC ANOMALY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Toska-74 </strong></i><strong>is an open-world survival-horror game that blends historical Soviet bleakness with surreal, mind-bending terror.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are dropped into a dense, unforgiving Siberian exclusion zone where the environment is turning on itself in a constant loop. Scavenge for supplies, destroy the lurking stalkers of the quarantine zone, and most importantly - try to keep your sanity intact as the world brutalizes your delicate mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/40e2e1665e265665e62fe3169709a3c1.poster.avif?t=1784908481\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/40e2e1665e265665e62fe3169709a3c1.webm?t=1784908481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/40e2e1665e265665e62fe3169709a3c1.mp4?t=1784908481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN (UN)COMMON ALLIANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The joint forces of the Yankees and the Commies have left - or been forced out of the exclusion zone. They are desperate. They are terrified.</strong> And they have agreed on one thing: <i>something will be done, no matter the costs.</i> Navigate the fragile politics of desperate men, fight against old, delicate Soviet robots and pillage abandoned research bunkers to uncover what really is going on. And one last thing, be careful when you go to sleep. Maybe this world isn't so bad after all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;There are no good or bad people in this world, yet there are walking corpses and those who refuse death&quot; </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/f1181754366446c6c811d6267f49905b.poster.avif?t=1784908481\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/f1181754366446c6c811d6267f49905b.webm?t=1784908481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/f1181754366446c6c811d6267f49905b.mp4?t=1784908481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Abomination:</strong> Explore a beautiful, open-world Siberia filled with brutalist architecture, abandoned military installations, floating, gravity-defying anomalies and be wary of the automated Soviet drones who, just like you will do anything to survive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychedelic Horror:</strong> The threat is personal and intimate. Hallucinations, reality distortions, and psychological terrors will make you question what is real and what is just your mind fracturing from the abomination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Of The Fittest:</strong> Ammo is scarce, robots wander and hover behind every corner, and every resource you find requires a risk-versus-reward choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>70s Soviet Aesthetic:</strong> Immerse yourself in a gritty, mind-bending sci-fi atmosphere heavily inspired by 1970s aesthetics, complete with period-accurate technology, industrial drones, and a haunting, oppressive existence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Created and manifested by VIKCHA-</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/f86ce947683f0280634d470f526c1f4b.poster.avif?t=1784908481\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/f86ce947683f0280634d470f526c1f4b.webm?t=1784908481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/f86ce947683f0280634d470f526c1f4b.mp4?t=1784908481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT TOSKA-74</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The year is 1974. Somewhere deep in the lush woods of Siberia, the firmament of reality has lost its grip.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without warning, the sky turned a suffocating, dense grey, then the sky lit up. Gravity lost its stronghold on the mundane—and the chairs rose to the ceiling. Reality has turned from an absolute - to a partial existence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;<i>He who fights with monsters should look to it that he himself does not become a monster. And if you gaze long into an abyss, the abyss also gazes into you.&quot; </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE PSYCHEDELIC ANOMALY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Toska-74 </strong></i><strong>is an open-world survival-horror game that blends historical Soviet bleakness with surreal, mind-bending terror.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are dropped into a dense, unforgiving Siberian exclusion zone where the environment is turning on itself in a constant loop. Scavenge for supplies, destroy the lurking stalkers of the quarantine zone, and most importantly - try to keep your sanity intact as the world brutalizes your delicate mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/40e2e1665e265665e62fe3169709a3c1.poster.avif?t=1784908481\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/40e2e1665e265665e62fe3169709a3c1.webm?t=1784908481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/extras/40e2e1665e26566