nd psychological terrors will make you question what is real and what is just your mind fracturing from the abomination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Of The Fittest:</strong> Ammo is scarce, robots wander and hover behind every corner, and every resource you find requires a risk-versus-reward choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>70s Soviet Aesthetic:</strong> Immerse yourself in a gritty, mind-bending sci-fi atmosphere heavily inspired by 1970s aesthetics, complete with period-accurate technology, industrial drones, and a haunting, oppressive existence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Created and manifested by VIKCHA-</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Toska-74 is a psychedelic, open-world survival-horror game set in a fictional 1974 Siberia. In a moment's notice the sky turned grey - and the chairs rose to the ceiling. The Yankees and Commies have settled. Something will be done, no matter the costs.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/797f1c1c1891f833b1b658eacabaaacafe69064c/header.jpg?t=1784908481", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/bf4b6dbc318ee49e1872ec14534486cb4c065d39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784908481", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856820/bf4b6dbc318ee49e1872ec14534486cb4c065d39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784908481", "website": "https://lightningrenders.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 6 cores<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requiremen